  1. copy, repost, mirror or redistribute all or part of the Work;
  2. modify or adapt the Work, or create derivative works based on it;
  3. use all or part of the Work for any commercial purpose (including but
     not limited to selling it, advertising, paid services, or commercial
     websites or apps);
  4. use the Work's name, characters or designs to impersonate or imply an
     association with Caroline.

You may: view this repository on GitHub; read the code in order to report
issues or suggestions; share unmodified links to this repository or the
website.

Third-party components (three.js, MediaPipe and its model, fonts, and 3D
models from Sketchfab / Poly Haven) remain the property of their authors and
are used under their own licenses, which this notice does not change. See
THIRD_PARTY.md.

